# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# Both come from the Supabase dashboard, Project Settings > API. The anon key is public by
# design: it ships inside the built JavaScript and anybody can read it. Row level security is
# what protects the data, not this key. Never put the service_role key in either file.
#
# Leave them empty or delete .env.local to fall back to the generated fixtures.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
